{
  "name": "Pretty Number Machine",
  "short_name": "PNM",
  "description": "An interactive visualisation of prime factorisation, where a number's colour is its factorisation: 2 is red, 3 is green, 5 is blue, and 6 is yellow because 2 x 3.",
